/* What iOS says when it asks for the camera. It never asks for the
   microphone, but the camera's code could record sound, so iOS wants
   it named all the same. */
"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "Quincena uses the camera only to read the QR code your other phone shows.";
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "Quincena does not use the microphone. The camera that reads your other phone's QR code records no sound.";
